    "notes": "36-CHANNEL LINE, quadruped_joint_grav_pose. The four foot_*_in_contact channels are dropped because the excitation corpus carries them as literal nan in 100% of rows -- the collector writes the columns and does not fill them. Deriving them with contact_mode() was ruled out after measuring it against the stored ground truth on the walking corpus: they agree on only 76.5% of samples, because the stored column is membership in Chrono's own contact container while contact_mode() is a hysteretic force threshold that exists for CRM, where the contact system reports nothing. Deriving would put a 23.5%-different quantity into one half of a pooled mix while the other half carried ground truth, and the pooling guard cannot see it because the NAMES would match. The confound is a property of the action and does not need contact conditioning, so the 36-channel line answers the sweep today. Cell batch_fraction=0.5 against the go2_mix36_base baseline."
